    "detailed_description": "Our friend Bob gos lost from his parents, and now we have to help him find them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur little dinosaur is both hunter and prey. You will have to act like a real dino if you want to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHe will have to explore and meet other creatures in different environments, as well as providing them with food to help them survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd there's no use in rushing to the end of the level. If he doesn't face a minimum amount of enemies and doesn't gather enough food, he won't proceed to the next level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe wanted to develop a game for the whole family. You will need to memorize the lay of the land to avoid getting lost, and also hone your skills to beat enemies.",
    "about_the_game": "Our friend Bob gos lost from his parents, and now we have to help him find them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur little dinosaur is both hunter and prey. You will have to act like a real dino if you want to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHe will have to explore and meet other creatures in different environments, as well as providing them with food to help them survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd there's no use in rushing to the end of the level. If he doesn't face a minimum amount of enemies and doesn't gather enough food, he won't proceed to the next level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe wanted to develop a game for the whole family. You will need to memorize the lay of the land to avoid getting lost, and also hone your skills to beat enemies.",
    "short_description": "Dino Lost is an adventure game for the whole family. You will be a little dinosaur who has lost his parents and now will have to fight off several enemies if he wants to survive.",
